merican (New), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"0yEl45kZ8o37lvpkhCBM4w","review_id":"uqDoghzvGkB4DLXDlZnT4g","date":"2021-12-22T14:16:16","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9355640411376953,"text_excerpt":"Monkey Board is the rooftop bar at the Troubadour. Happy hour is 4 to 6 nightly and a very nice selection of drinks are available for $6 each. Everything we had was tasty and a decent pour (not \"my bar at home during Covid pours\" but still good!). The view is of buildings and the very top of the Superdome but it's in a city, what else do you want? The sunset made everything glow which was cool (in the winter you get a sunset with your happy hour)! It's definitely \"3 seasons\" with large windows that I assume are open in warmer weather. In colder weather they have heaters which is a nice touch. The staff was friendly and responsive. We have been making our list of things to see and do while..."},{"business_id":"0yEl45kZ8o37lvpkhCBM4w","review_id":"FRG177UINIRcCCTiqQNRNw","date":"2017-01-20T12:21:55","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.929410994052887,"text_excerpt":"This bar is the newest rooftop bar in Nola. The views are one of the best in New Orleans and it gives you a full unobstructed 360 view of downtown New Orleans. The drinks are about average for downtown/French quarter drinks. The beers are really cheap. We got the beers on draft in their mugs that you get to keep and it was $2 to refill! Go check this place out, it's a perfect date night bar. The only complaint I have is that they need more lighting around the seating area for people to see and talk to each other."},{"business_id":"0yEl45kZ8o37lvpkhCBM4w","review_id":"tJnBi6MkxD7ICz72s0mtLg","date":"2020-08-18T01:15:47","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9291066527366638,"text_excerpt":"I love love love Monkey board Bar. Its one of my favorite rooftop bars in the city. The atmosphere is nice, they play mild techno music in the background which is ok for the vibe. The do sell food along with drinks which is nice and their food is always delicious. We had Frozen Sangrias and a Hurricane which was pretty good but it tasted more sweet than strong which I didnt like therefore I needed 2 drinks. But overall I would still recommend and come back to this place a million times because the staff, the vibe and the view is so nice"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"0yEl45kZ8o37lvpkhCBM4w","photo_id":"fmyFtMu-TqvXi49JkmmVqw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/fmyFtMu-TqvXi49JkmmVqw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8688485622406006},{"business_id":"0yEl45kZ8o37lvpkhCBM4w","photo_id":"RSY0dPQeULeGVp2KBy90jQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/RSY0dPQeULeGVp2KBy90jQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8638916015625},{"business_id":"0yEl45kZ8o37